; The microphone's jack. Its local +Z points out of the front face, so a plug
; seated through the half-turn every SnapGrabPoint carries drives its shaft INTO
; the shell. n64_vru.gd narrows it to the microphone plug's own group: snap_require
; alone would take a console controller's plug.
